[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4777096931","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120566#issuecomment-4777096931","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120566","id":4777096931,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHLy24w","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-23T08:10:08Z","updated_at":"2026-06-23T09:43:17Z","body":"Sounds like it could be:\n* https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120504","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4777096931/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":{"reason":"outdated"}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4777855720","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120566#issuecomment-4777855720","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120566","id":4777855720,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHMhK6A","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-23T09:40:28Z","updated_at":"2026-06-23T09:40:28Z","body":"> Sounds like it could be:\n> \n> * [[MacOS] Godot crashes upon close when using Metal due to non-existent cache entry #120504](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120504)\n\nThat issue is a regression unique to 4.8-dev, so it's likely not the same problem seen here on 4.7-stable.\n\nCC @stuartcarnie @blueskythlikesclouds ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4777855720/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4780162261","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120566#issuecomment-4780162261","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120566","id":4780162261,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHOt81Q","user":{"login":"shharn","id":16559503,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTU5NTAz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16559503?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shharn","html_url":"https://github.com/shharn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shharn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shharn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shharn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shharn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shharn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shharn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shharn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shharn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shharn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-23T14:14:55Z","updated_at":"2026-06-23T14:14:55Z","body":"It looks like metal copy-queue staging buffer overflow (alignment applied after the copy). I backtraced my project and found this lines:\n\n```\n#7  -[MTLDebugBlitCommandEncoder copyFromBuffer:sourceOffset:toBuffer:destinationOffset:size:]  ← Metal ABORTS here\n#9  MTL::BlitCommandEncoder::copyFromBuffer(sourceOffset=65544, destinationOffset=0, size=8)\n#10 RenderingDeviceDriverMetal::_copy_queue_copy_to_buffer(p_src_data=(_len=8), p_dst_offset=0)   rendering_device_driver_metal.cpp:2488\n```\n\nWatch the offset approach the 64 KB edge. Say offset = 65528, and a copy of size = 8 comes in (your arg-buffer copy):\n\n1. available = 65536 − 65528 = 8. Check: 8 < 8? No → no flush.\n2. memcpy + blit at offset 65528, 8 bytes → uses bytes 65528–65535. In bounds, fine.\n3. consume(8): aligned = round_up(65528, 16) = 65536, then offset = 65536 + 8 =  65544. Boom\n\nNot sure yet. I might miss something in big picture","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4780162261/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4783393430","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120566#issuecomment-4783393430","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120566","id":4783393430,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHRzKlg","user":{"login":"stuartcarnie","id":52852,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52852?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie","html_url":"https://github.com/stuartcarnie","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-23T20:55:49Z","updated_at":"2026-06-23T20:55:49Z","body":"@shharn good find – that was the issue. \n\n- #120589","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4783393430/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godo